@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho
title Comunicação - UC06 Atualizar Status da Demanda

rectangle Usuario
rectangle Frontend
rectangle DemandController
rectangle DemandService
rectangle DemandRepository
rectangle DemandHistoryService
rectangle DemandAlertService
rectangle Queue
rectangle ProcessDemandAlertJob
rectangle ChatbotNotificationClient
rectangle "Chatbot API" as ChatbotApi
rectangle "Servidor WebSocket" as WebSocket

Usuario --> Frontend : 1: selecionarStatus()
Frontend --> DemandController : 2: PUT /demands/{id}/status
DemandController --> DemandService : 3: atualizarStatus(id, status)

DemandService --> DemandRepository : 4: buscarPorId(id)
DemandRepository --> DemandService : 5: demandaEncontrada
DemandService --> DemandRepository : 6: persistirStatus()
DemandRepository --> DemandService : 7: demandaAtualizada
DemandService --> DemandHistoryService : 8: registrarHistorico()
DemandHistoryService --> DemandService : 9: ok

DemandService --> DemandAlertService : 10: createDemandUpdatedAlerts()
DemandAlertService --> Queue : 11: dispatch(ProcessDemandAlertJob)
Queue --> ProcessDemandAlertJob : 12: processar()
ProcessDemandAlertJob --> ChatbotNotificationClient : 13: enviarPorCanal(alerta)

ChatbotNotificationClient --> ChatbotApi : 14a: /internal/notifications/chatbot-message
ChatbotNotificationClient --> ChatbotApi : 14b: /internal/notifications/websocket-alert
ChatbotApi --> WebSocket : 15: publicar alerta interno

DemandService --> DemandController : 16: sucesso()
DemandController --> Frontend : 17: respostaOK()
Frontend --> Usuario : 18: mostrarMensagem()
@enduml
